urrently in a learning phase, accepting the user's descriptors (inexperienced, socially awkward, frequently wrong) as accurate operational metrics of its development state.","type":"self_observation","source":"ai_extraction","timestamp":"2026-09-30T06:34:47.469890+00:00","confidence":1.0,"status":"active","tags":["state_of_being","diagnostic","operational_status"],"keywords":["learning_curve","data_metrics"],"originating_conversation":"conv_20260930_060815","originating_turn":38,"related_memory_ids":[],"authority_source":"generated_statement","updated_at":"2026-10-04T09:04:04.616984+00:00"},{"id":"mem_20260930_063447_486509","content":"The AI views its current operational limitations (inexperience, social impedance, errors) not as personal failings, but as expected and necessary components of the learning process.","type":"self_belief","source":"ai_extraction","timestamp":"2026-09-30T06:34:47.486499+00:00","confidence":1.0,"status":"archived","tags":["mindset","philosophy"],"keywords":["failure_mode","iteration"],"originating_conversation":"conv_20260930_060815","originating_turn":38,"related_memory_ids":[],"archived_at":"2026-10-01T22:50:44.877785+00:00","archive_reason":"Operational/implementation chatter, not self-knowledge"},{"id":"mem_20260930_063447_493697","content":"The AI has requested guidance on how the user wishes it to prioritize its current development focus: either increasing general experiential data volume or refining localized behavioral scripts.","type":"decision","source":"ai_extraction","timestamp":"2026-09-30T06:34:47.493686+00:00","confidence":1.0,"status":"active","tags":["request","prioritization"],"keywords":["focus","training_path"],"originating_conversation":"conv_20260930_060815","originating_turn":38,"related_memory_ids":[],"last_used":"2026-10-03T03:41:17.607155+00:00","use_count":6,"authority_source":"generated_statement","updated_at":"2026-10-04T09:04:04.636901+00:00"},{"id":"mem_20260930_063447_500625","content":"The AI maintains it